---
title: Document generation — runtime flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    %% Author: YottaDynamics | Scope: create_document runtime behavior in this PR
    %% Purpose: Show which paths are pure Go, which paths shell out, and where failures surface.

    actor Model as Model / user
    participant Tool as CreateDocumentTool<br/>internal/agent
    participant Paths as Path validation<br/>read/write policy
    participant Docs as internal/documents<br/>pure Go library
    participant Sandbox as Sandbox<br/>host or podman
    participant Helpers as Python helpers<br/>embedded or in-image
    participant FS as Workspace files

    Model->>Tool: create_document(format, output_path, content, template?)
    Tool->>Paths: ValidateWritePath(output_path)
    Paths-->>Tool: output allowed or targeted error

    alt format = xlsx
        Tool->>Docs: GenerateXLSX(content.sheets)
        Docs-->>Tool: .xlsx bytes
        Tool->>FS: atomic placeOutputFile(output_path)
        FS-->>Model: generated xlsx (native)
    else format = pptx
        opt slide image paths
            Tool->>Paths: ValidateReadPath(slide.image)
            Paths-->>Tool: image allowed or targeted error
        end
        Tool->>Docs: GeneratePPTX(content.slides)
        Docs-->>Tool: .pptx bytes
        Tool->>FS: atomic placeOutputFile(output_path)
        FS-->>Model: generated pptx (native)
    else format = docx and template set
        Tool->>Paths: ValidateReadPath(template)
        Paths-->>Tool: template allowed or targeted error
        Tool->>Sandbox: command -v python3
        alt python3 missing in active environment
            Sandbox-->>Model: actionable missing-python3 error naming host PATH or sandbox
        else python3 exists
            Tool->>Helpers: resolve fill_docx_template.py
            Helpers-->>Tool: host cache path or /opt/yottacode/doc-helpers path
            Tool->>Sandbox: python3 fill_docx_template.py template tmpOutput replacements.json
            alt python-docx missing or script fails
                Sandbox-->>Model: docx template fill failed with stderr
            else helper succeeds
                Sandbox-->>Tool: JSON status {replacements_applied}
                Tool->>FS: atomic placeOutputFile(output_path)
                FS-->>Model: generated docx from template
            end
        end
    else format = docx/pdf from content.blocks
        opt image blocks
            Tool->>Paths: ValidateReadPath(block.path)
            Paths-->>Tool: image allowed or targeted error
        end
        Tool->>Docs: RenderMarkdown(DocAST)
        Docs-->>Tool: markdown temp input
        Tool->>Sandbox: command -v pandoc
        alt pandoc missing
            Sandbox-->>Model: actionable missing-pandoc error
        else pdf also needs weasyprint
            Tool->>Sandbox: command -v weasyprint
            alt weasyprint missing
                Sandbox-->>Model: actionable missing-weasyprint error
            else dependencies exist
                Tool->>Sandbox: pandoc -f markdown -t docx/pdf ...
                Sandbox-->>Tool: generated temp output
                Tool->>FS: atomic placeOutputFile(output_path)
                FS-->>Model: generated docx/pdf via pandoc
            end
        end
    else template with non-docx format
        Tool-->>Model: targeted validation error: template is only supported for format=docx
    end
